{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "SlimeCraft",
    "steam_appid": 3817050,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817050/extras/12b2b8e7793f9a3a050de71238321141.avif?t=1754914392\" width=800 height=450 /></span>SlimeCraft is a bullet heaven and roguelike crafting game where you take control of a blue slime in a mystical realm. You must mine objects to gather resources and manage your inventory to prepare for oncoming waves of enemies. Craft barricades and powerful magic items to build your defense, the longer you survive the higher your score. Find treasure, destroy spawners, and discover portals to other worlds as you continue exploring through space and time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Features:</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft everything from a delicious piece of cake to a powerful magic weapon of doom!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hordes of colorful slime mobs to swarm and annihilate you without hesitation!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a massive slime dimension where nearly everything can be mined!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An infinite gameplay loop designed for bullet heaven, roguelike, and crafting fans!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Controls:</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move with [WASD]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press [Tab] to access inventory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold the [Left Mouse Button] to mine, craft, and attack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press [Escape] to quit the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press [R] to restart the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scroll the [Mouse Wheel] to navigate the crafting menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the\u00a0[Right Mouse Button] to throw items away</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press [M] to mute audio and [P] to play audio</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Hints:</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items won't disappear, you can come back for them later.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies can stack on top of each other and deliver a more powerful blow to the player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's no point in saving food, heal up as soon as you can.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies of the night can pass through barricades, slimes can potentially slip through them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure to build an offense, you can't survive with only barricades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moon magic can always hurt enemies of the night.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Credits:</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by Jeremy Ulrich</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music by trndytrndy</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817050/extras/12b2b8e7793f9a3a050de71238321141.avif?t=1754914392\" width=800 height=450 /></span>SlimeCraft is a bullet heaven and roguelike crafting game where you take control of a blue slime in a mystical realm. You must mine objects to gather resources and manage your inventory to prepare for oncoming waves of enemies. Craft barricades and powerful magic items to build your defense, the longer you survive the higher your score. Find treasure, destroy spawners, and discover portals to other worlds as you continue exploring through space and time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Features:</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft everything from a delicious piece of cake to a powerful magic weapon of doom!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hordes of colorful slime mobs to swarm and annihilate you without hesitation!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a massive slime dimension where nearly everything can be mined!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An infinite gameplay loop designed for bullet heaven, roguelike, and crafting fans!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Controls:</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move with [WASD]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press [Tab] to access inventory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold the [Left Mouse Button] to mine, craft, and attack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press [Escape] to quit the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press [R] to restart the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scroll the [Mouse Wheel] to navigate the crafting menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the\u00a0[Right Mouse Button] to throw items away</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press [M] to mute audio and [P] to play audio</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Hints:</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items won't disappear, you can come back for them later.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies can stack on top of each other and deliver a more powerful blow to the player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's no point in saving food, heal up as soon as you can.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies of the night can pass through barricades, slimes can potentially slip through them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure to build an offense, you can't survive with only barricades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moon magic can always hurt enemies of the night.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Credits:</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by Jeremy Ulrich</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music by trndytrndy</p>",
    "short_description": "SlimeCraft is a bullet heaven and crafting roguelike where the player mines objects, gathers resources, and crafts items to defend themself against waves of enemies in order to continue their journey exploring the slime dimension.",
